\section{System Model}
\label{sec:system_model}
We consider a single‐cell 5G~NR downlink\footnote{Uplink ({UL}) is analogous, using Buffer Status Reports ({BSR}s) for queue state information at the {gNB} scheduler's {CBS} logic.} that operates in \emph{frequency-division duplex} (FDD).  
A  gNB  serves a finite set of static UEs
%
\(
\mathcal U\triangleq\{1,\dots,U\}\!
\), as shown in Fig.\ref{Fig_sys},with the 3GPP Urban Macro (UMa) channel model~\cite{Haneda}.   
Uplink control signaling--buffer status reports (BSRs) and channel quality indicator (CQI)--is assumed timely and error-free.
