\subsection{Ablation Study}
\label{43abl}


To quantitatively evaluate how our two core modules, Chain of Grounding (CoG) and the Spatial Representation Extraction Toolkit, each contribute to overall system performance, we conducted a set of ablation studies. These ablations reuse the tasks from Sec. \ref{4.1db} and evaluate success rate and average completion time as metrics. When the Toolkit is removed, we employ a single fixed extractor; when CoG is removed, the VLM is invoked with only a simple prompt to produce the required outputs. 


