\item \textbf{The correlated bids among the bundles.} Although JTransNet inputs the bid of each bundle to enhance the learning of bundle bid information, it ultimately converts the allocation results of each bundle for each ad slot into the allocation results for each store or brand for each ad slot, and calculates the final payment based on the independent bids of the stores and brands. This method prevents payments from depending on bundle bids, effectively mitigating the issue of correlated bids.

