Determining the individual payments of the store and brand within each bundle that obtains an ad slot is complex. To tackle this issue, JTransNet optimizes a set of parameters to scale the total expected value of  each store and brand, and the scaled values are defined as their payments. JTransNet uses a sigmoid function to calculate each parameter, guaranteeing that the payment is consistently lower than the bid, and satisfying IR.

