\textbf{Baseline Methods.} The baseline methods used for comparison with JTransNet include: RegretNet \cite{dutting2019optimal}, which can generate the optimal auction mechanisms satisfying near-DSIC and IR in traditional ad settings that only include stores; VCG \cite{vickrey1961counterspeculation, clarke1971multipart, groves1973incentives}, a widely used mechanism that satisfies DSIC and IR, which is applied to the joint ad setting in our experiments; and JAMA \cite{ma2024joint}, a VCG-based  mechanism suitable for joint ad settings.

