To further demonstrate the effectiveness of JTransNet, we deploy JTransNet in the joint auction scenario on a real e-commerce platform and conduct an A/B test to further validate the effectiveness of JTransNet. During March 2024, we conduct the online A/B tests on 40\% of the traffic, and JTransNet achieves a substantial revenue increase of +1.87\%, compared to the joint auction mechanism that the e-commerce platform was using at that time. 
