Suppose that $\sigma$ is constant-free, $\varphi$ is a $\GMLiu(\sigma)$-formula or $\varphi(x)$ is an equality-free $\CT(\sigma)$-formula, and that $\mx<\kappa<\kappa'\in \mathbb{N}^{\infty}$. Then \mbox{$\Amf^\kappa \models \varphi(a,i)$} iff $\Amf^\kappa \models \Flat(\varphi)(a,i)$
