We use $\mathfrak{S}^*$ to construct the required $\Amf_{i},a_{i}$, $i=1,2$,	and $\MLiu(\varrho)$-bisimulation $\bis$ between them. For every $M\in \mathfrak{S}^{\ast}$, take a witness $\mathcal{M}_{M}\subseteq \mathfrak{S}^{\ast}$ for $M$ together with the corresponding relations $S^{M,\mathcal{M}_{M}} \subseteq \Delta^{M} \times \Gamma^{M}$ between $\Delta^{M}=\Delta_1^M \cup \Delta_2^M$ and $\Gamma^{M}=\Gamma_1^M \cup \Gamma_2^M$.
