\end{align}
%
%
%
%
%
	\(\textmaxnorm{\Delta_{\mat{H}_i}}\) is equal to~\({\textbigmaxnorm{\comp{\beta^{(\ell-1)}}\bigl({\comp{\row{\mat{L}}{i}\cdot{u}},\comp{\row{\mat{R}}{i}\cdot{v}}}\bigr)-\beta^{(\ell-1)}(\row{\mat{L}}{i}\cdot{u},\row{\mat{R}}{i}\cdot{v})}}\) by bilinearity of~\(\beta^{(\ell-1)}\) and bounded by:
