Our approach transforms a dataset $\bx = (x_1, x_2, \ldots, x_n) \in \cX^n$ of conversations 
into high-level summaries $\bs = (s_1, \ldots, s_m) \in \cS^m$ through three stages.
The pseudocode can be found in \Cref{alg:non-dp-pipeline} with the implementation details as discussed below.

