to find a control input $u_i\in U_{a}$ that minimizes the Hamiltonian function $H_i(e_i,u_i,\nabla_{e_i} V_i^*(e_i))$, subject to the graph CBF safety constraint in \eqref{CBF_N_R}. The resulting constrained optimization problem is described by 
\begin{subequations}\label{const-hjb}
\begin{align}
