Below, we present the detailed design of each individual loss function. 
% where $L_{vi}(\theta,\varphi)$, $L_{hi}(\omega,\varphi)$, and $L_{\pi i}(\theta,\omega,\varphi)$ denote the corresponding loss functions of each agent $i$, $i\in V_a$, 
% % the value function loss, the GCBF loss, and the distributed controller loss,
